WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.333
This tool cannot export my work.

00:00:04.333 --> 00:00:09.233
What if I could change it myself?

00:00:09.233 --> 00:00:14.233
Open source shares the code...

00:00:14.233 --> 00:00:18.567
...and a license to use it.

00:00:18.567 --> 00:00:21.367
I may use, study, modify and share.

00:00:21.367 --> 00:00:25.700
I make my own copy.

00:00:25.700 --> 00:00:31.867
I add the export feature and test it.

00:00:31.867 --> 00:00:35.533
I send the fix back to the project.

00:00:35.533 --> 00:00:40.200
A maintainer reviews it. Approval is not automatic.

00:00:40.200 --> 00:00:43.500
Accepted!

00:00:43.500 --> 00:00:50.800
The fix ships in a new release.

00:00:50.800 --> 00:00:54.633
Others reuse it and share improvements.

00:00:54.633 --> 00:00:58.433
Follow the license: obligations vary.
